<div class="block block-commission-boost">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="top-title">
                12BET COMMISSION BOOST
            </div>
            <div class="mid-title">
                EARN UP TO A WHOPPING 50% COMMISSION!
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Get higher monthly commission rates with ease - simply meet the requirements below to qualify automatically!
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Promotion/Partial/_CommissionBoostTable.cshtml"); }

<div class="block block-note">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title">
                NOTE
            </div>
            <div class="main-content">
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-number">01</div>
                    <div class="items-description">
                        If the affiliate achieves varying thresholds for [total profit per month] and [qualified active players for a month] then the commission payout will be based on the lower threshold. For instance, if the total Net loss of the affiliate's members for the current month is $46,000, and the Qualified active members are 7, the commission for the period will be <span>35%</span>.
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-number">02</div>
                    <div class="items-description">
                        By invitation only - If you believe you have a unique proposition that could result in significant Winloss (such as attracting VIP members), you can reach out to the affiliate manager to evaluate the proposition and determine the eligibility.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="block block-power">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title">
                FDM's POWER
            </div>
            <div class="block-child-description">
                In 12BET, extra rewards are always guaranteed. All you need to do is fulfil the stated New FDM's requirements and receive an extra commission in addition to your commission.
            </div>
        </div>
        @{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/Promotion/Partial/_FDMsPowerTable.cshtml"); }
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-note">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title title-spcing">
                NOTE
            </div>
            <div class="main-content">
                <div class="items">
                    <div class="items-description">
                        Every affiliate will receive an extra percentage in addition to the commission they earn, regardless of whether it's a Regular Commission or a 12BET Commission Boost promotion.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-example">
    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="group-page">
            <div class="block-child-title title-spcing">
                THE COMMISSION CALCULATION EXAMPLE:
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Imagin a ‘Affiliate XYZ’ has a <span class="red-bold">Net win/loss</span> of $35,000, and there are 25 qualified active members and 12 FDMs. The total deposit made by FDMs is $3,000. The individual qualifies for both promotions, which are the 12BET Commission Boost and FDM Power.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                To calculate the commission, we first apply the Commission Boost, which is 35% of $35,000, resulting in $12,250.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Next, we apply FDM Power to the Commission Boost amount, which is 3%. Therefore, the FDM Power bonus is $367.5, but since the maximum bonus is $250, the commission will be $12,250 + $250 = $12,500.
            </div>
            <div class="description">
                Thus, the total commission earned by the Affiliate XYZ is $12,500.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="block block-faq">
    <div class="block-content">
        <div class="page-container">
            <div class="group-faq">
                <div class="question">
                    <div class="title">
                        <span>TERMS AND CONDITIONS</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="button-toggle"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="anwser">
                    <div class="anwser-heading">Monthly Commission Boost</div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">1</span> This promotion applies to all 12BET Affiliates.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">2</span> If the affiliate achieves varying thresholds for [total profit per month] and [qualified active players for a month] then the commission payout will be based on the lower threshold.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">3</span> Non-qualifiers of this promotion will continue to earn commissions based on the existing <a href="@Url.Content("~/CommissionStructure")">Regular commission structure.</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">4</span> By invitation only - If you believe you have a unique proposition that could result in significant Winloss (such as attracting VIP members), you can reach out to the affiliate manager to evaluate the proposition and determine the eligibility.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">5</span> Affiliates will be eligible to get an extra commission if they can hit the requirements as indicated in the table above.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">6</span> Extra Commission will calculate from the final commission of the preceding month.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">7</span> Extra Commission will be credited with the final commission within the 08th - 15th of the month.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">8</span> 12BET reserves the right to cancel this promotion at any time, either for all affiliates or individual affiliates and its subject to <a href="@Url.Content("~/TermAndCondition")">12BET Affiliates Terms and Conditions.</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="group-faq">
                <div class="question">
                    <div class="title">
                        <span>FDM's POWER</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="button-toggle"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="anwser">
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">1</span> This promotion applies to all 12BET Affiliates.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">2</span> If the [NEW FDM's Reached] and [Total FDM's Deposit] are at different levels, the lower level will be used for commission calculation.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">3</span> Affiliates will be eligible to get an extra commission if they can hit the requirements as indicated in the table above.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">4</span> Extra Commission will calculate from the final commission of the preceding month.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">5</span> Extra Commission will be credited with the final commission within the 08th - 15th of the month.
                    </div>
                    <div class="anwser-text">
                        <span class="list-number">6</span> 12BET reserves the right to cancel this promotion at any time, either for all affiliates or individual affiliates and its subject to <a href="@Url.Content("~/TermAndCondition")">12BET Affiliates Terms and Conditions.</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>